# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DVC-tracked data (see .dvc/config, `make data-pull`)
#
# These four paths hold real vendor/commenter data or regenerable pipeline
# output. They are versioned in DVC and stored in Cloudflare R2, NOT in git -
# each one has a committed *.dvc pointer file recording its content hash, so
# every git commit pins the exact data it was produced against.
#
# The actual ignore rules are written by DVC itself into scoped .gitignore
# files next to each path (eval/.gitignore, data/.gitignore, and the two
# entries at the bottom of this file) - don't duplicate them here.
#
#   eval/golden/     hand-labeled golden sets. IRREPLACEABLE: the labels
#                    cannot be regenerated by make_golden_skeleton.py.
#   runs/            raw Graph API dumps (vendor + commenter data)
#   data/snapshots/  Stage 6 baselines incl. caption embeddings
#   report/          harness predictions + token_log.csv (append-only cost
#                    history that FINDINGS.md's tables were computed from)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets - includes .dvc/config.local (R2 credentials), ignored by .dvc/.gitignore
.env
*.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

.vscode/

# Scratch/working files - local only
scratch_*.txt
scratch_*.json
*.bak

# --- written by `dvc add` ---
/report
